    },
    {
      "claim": "The only new potentially negative L2 statement, C22, is qualitative and contradicted by the L1 absolute F of 42% for telmisartan in fasting volunteers; it does not provide affirmative threshold-relevant F < 20% evidence.",
      "card_ids": ["C22", "C09"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "High absolute F for safinamide (about 95%) further illustrates high F in this dataset, though structural transferability to the query is lower.",
      "card_ids": ["C03", "C04", "C13", "C19", "C21"]
